              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Aeburania 3:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Mwenyezi Mlungu ariphokuhumani kula Kadeshi-Barinea achiamba, ‘Ambukani mkaimiliki tsi ambayo nkakuphani,’ mwimwi mwaasi amuriye. Tamyamuamini Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu wala kuhenda gara arigokuambirani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwimwi mukakala aasi mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu hangu siku nriphokumanyani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kpwa hivyo, nádzibwaga chimabumabu mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu kpwa siku mirongo mine, usiku na mutsi kpwa sababu Mwenyezi Mlungu kala akaamba andakuangamizani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nchivoya Mwenyezi Mlungu, nchiamba, ‘Ee Mwenyezi Mlungu, usiangamize atuo ambao ni urisio, atu urioakombola kpwa ukuluo na urioatuluza kula tsi ya Misiri kpwa uwezoo mkpwulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tambukira atumishio Burahimu, Isaka na Jakobo, wala usijali likakado, uyi na dambi za atu hinya ariohipha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sedze atu a kura urikohutuluza akaamba, “Mwenyezi Mlungu waatuluza kusudi aolage jangbwani kpwa sababu kayaweza kuainjiza tsi ariyolaga na kpwa sababu waamena.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana, hinya ni atuo na urisio, atu ambao waakombola kpwa uwezoo, atu urioatuluza we mwenye Misiri.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
